# Dialogue portrait window (#337, D78, D134): carved walnut band 8 px, gilt bead on its inner side, gilt rosettes in the
# corners; nine-patch, insets 12 px. Frame "lit" is the speaker, "dim" the listener: every colour x0.5, the two bright gilts capped (D78).
# The shadow sides (right, bottom) carry 2 px of shadow walnut (b; i when dim) inside the 1 px outline, so the band shows 7 px on all four sides (D134).
# The opening is a dusk blue (3d4a68), light enough that the portraits' dark contours read against it (D76 by analogy).
